# Normalize line endings in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout inherits core.autocrlf=true and rewrites LF
# to CRLF, which the formatter reads as a whole-file diff. The Windows CI job
# then fails lint on all 213 source files while the same commit is green on
# macOS. Pinning the checkout to LF makes the working tree identical everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must stay byte-exact, never line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
*.p12 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
